{"id":"d05a25a3b2cd","path":"/en/university/info/alumni/network/chapters","lang":"en","title":"Chapters","description":"USI Alumni Chapters The Chapters bring together Alumni who live and work in the same country / city and want to keep in touch with each other and USI. Each Chapter is coordinated by one or more alumni who act as a local Chapter Lead. As of today, there are: 76 USI Alumni Chapter ","section":"University","crumbs":["University","Info","Alumni","Network"],"image":null,"words":947,"alternates":{"it":"/it/universita/info/alumni/network/chapters","en":"/en/university/info/alumni/network/chapters"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"University","path":"/en/originalnode/8524"},{"label":"Info","path":"/en/originalnode/14049"},{"label":"Alumni","path":"/en/university/info/alumni"},{"label":"Network","path":"/en/university/info/alumni/network"},{"label":"Chapters","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"html","html":"<p><strong>USI Alumni Chapters</strong></p> <p>The Chapters bring together Alumni who live and work in the same country / city and want to keep in touch with each other and USI. Each Chapter is coordinated by one or more alumni who act as a local Chapter Lead.</p> <p>As of today, there are:</p> <ul> <li><strong>76 </strong>USI Alumni Chapter Leads</li> <li><strong>51 </strong>Cities</li> <li><strong>34 </strong>Countries</li> </ul> <p>The objective of the Chapter is to <strong>foster relationships between graduates and USI, create connections with local professionals, and promote the University in the area</strong>, through activities and meetings.</p> <p>Find your local Chapter or volunteer to create an USI Chapter in your city: write to <a href=\"mailto:alumni@usi.ch\">alumni@usi.ch</a></p> <p><strong>Chapter Leads</strong></p> <p><a href=\"/en/originalnode/11426\"><strong>Chapter Leads</strong></a> are alumni who volunteer to become the local contact for all USI Alumni living and working in the same area, wishing to get together and stay in touch among each other and with USI.</p> <p>Chapter Leads are alumni leaders who are committed to supporting the University and connecting alumni with each other by volunteering time, energy and talent.</p> <p>Every USI Alumni visiting, moving to or interested in the specific geographical area/city, professors in sabbatical or travelling to a conference and students who are doing an internship are very welcome to get connected with the local Chapter Lead.</p> <p><a href=\"/en/node/8327\">Click here</a> to see Alumni Chapter Meetings around the world.</p><p><strong>USI ALUMNI CHAPTERS </strong></p> <table> <tbody> <tr> <th> <p>Chapter</p> </th> <th> <p>City</p> </th> <th> <p>Chapter Leads</p> </th> <th> <p>USI Degree</p> </th> <th> <p>Company</p> </th> <th> <p>Contact</p> </th> </tr> <tr> <td> <p>ALBANIA</p> </td> <td> <p><strong>Tirana</strong></p> </td> <td> <p><a href=\"/en/node/8345\">Alfons Shtjefni</a></p> </td> <td> <p>MARC, 2008</p> </td> <td> <p>ArkPro</p> </td> <td> <p><a href=\"mailto:alfons.shtjefni@alumni.usi.ch\">Email</a></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <p>ARGENTINA</p> </td> <td> <p><strong>Buenos Aires</strong></p> </td> <td> <p><a href=\"/en/node/8345\">Santiago Abdala</a></p> </td> <td> <p>MFC, 2007</p> </td> <td> <p>Portfolio Personal Inversiones</p> </td> <td> <p><a href=\"mailto:santiago.abdala@alumni.usi.ch\">Email</a></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <p>AUSTRALIA</p> </td> <td> <p><a href=\"/en/originalnode/11584\"><strong>Sydney</strong></a></p> </td> <td> <p><a href=\"/en/originalnode/11426\">Paolo Zazzara<br> Ashley Thalmann</a></p> </td> <td> <p>MFin, 2010<br> MT, 2019</p> </td> <td> <p>Pepper Money ANZ<br> University of Wollongong</p> </td> <td> <p><a href=\"mailto:paolo.zazzara@alumni.usi.ch\">Email</a><br> <a href=\"mailto:ashley.thalmann@alumni.usi.ch\">Email</a></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <p>AUSTRIA</p> </td> <td><strong>Vienna</strong></td> <td><a href=\"/en/originalnode/11426\">Laura Malinverno</a></td> <td>MT, 2012</td> <td>WU</td> <td><a